and credential-safety guidance, scopes external writes, adds UI/UX quality
gates, and makes retrieval of screenshots, HTML, DESIGN.md, and implementation
handoff explicit. Modified files are marked by this NOTICE and UPSTREAM.md.

The 2026-08-03 update optimizes the skill contracts for GPT-5.6 prompting:
leaner instructions, contextual design decisions, bounded tool routing,
intentional image-detail selection, and non-conflicting completion rules.

The 2026-08-05 update aligns all five skills with the current callable Stitch
schemas, adds evidence-based degraded states and recoverable bounded workflow
handoffs, hardens local artifact retrieval, and adds minimal Codex skill UI
metadata without bundling authentication or an MCP server.

